# Default-deny, then allow only what the image build needs. Mirrors the
# posture of the repository root .dockerignore: an allow-list cannot leak a
# file that nobody remembered to exclude.
#
# node_modules is excluded on purpose. The build runs `npm ci` from the
# lockfile inside the image, so copying a host-resolved tree in would both
# bloat the context and risk shipping macOS-arm64 native binaries into a
# Linux image.

*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!vite.config.ts
!index.html
!Caddyfile
!src
!scripts
